{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Let them be cast down — burning coals</b>: from heaven, as in \"burning coals went forth from Him\" and \"hail and coals of fire.\"" "<b>He will cast them into fire</b>: this is the stone that kills by its smell, all the more so by its body." "<b>Into pits</b>: a low place, on account of \"they shall not rise up\"; and there is no equivalent for it in our language."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 140, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:42:22.253201111Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}